<title>USA: Service files shelf for $1 bln offering.</title>
<headline>Service files shelf for $1 bln offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Service Corp International filed Monday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $1 billion in debt securities, common stock and common stock warrants.  </p>
<p>The Houston company said the net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes including repurchases of outstanding long-term debt securities, capital expenditures, investments in subsidiaries, working capital and other business opportunities.</p>
<p>The filing did not list the underwriters.</p>
</text>
